{
  "an2.1:0.1": "Aṅguttara Nikāya 2 ",
  "an2.1:0.2": "1. Kammakaraṇavagga ",
  "an2.1:1.0": "1. Vajjasutta ",
  "an2.1:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "an2.1:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā sāvatthiyaṁ viharati jetavane anāthapiṇḍikassa ārāme. ",
  "an2.1:1.3": "Tatra kho bhagavā bhikkhū āmantesi: ",
  "an2.1:1.4": "“bhikkhavo”ti. ",
  "an2.1:1.5": "“Bhadante”ti te bhikkhū bhagavato paccassosuṁ. ",
  "an2.1:1.6": "Bhagavā etadavoca: ",
  "an2.1:2.1": "“Dvemāni, bhikkhave, vajjāni. ",
  "an2.1:2.2": "Katamāni dve? ",
  "an2.1:2.3": "Diṭṭhadhammikañca vajjaṁ samparāyikañca vajjaṁ. ",
  "an2.1:2.4": "Katamañca, bhikkhave, diṭṭhadhammikaṁ vajjaṁ? ",
  "an2.1:2.5": "Idha, bhikkhave, ekacco passati coraṁ āgucāriṁ rājāno gahetvā vividhā kammakāraṇā kārente; ",
  "an2.1:2.6": "kasāhipi tāḷente, vettehipi tāḷente, addhadaṇḍakehipi tāḷente, hatthampi chindante, pādampi chindante, hatthapādampi chindante, kaṇṇampi chindante, nāsampi chindante, kaṇṇanāsampi chindante, bilaṅgathālikampi karonte, saṅkhamuṇḍikampi karonte, rāhumukhampi karonte, jotimālikampi karonte, hatthapajjotikampi karonte, erakavattikampi karonte, cīrakavāsikampi karonte, eṇeyyakampi karonte, baḷisamaṁsikampi karonte, kahāpaṇikampi karonte, khārāpatacchikampi karonte, palighaparivattikampi karonte, palālapīṭhakampi karonte, tattenapi telena osiñcante, sunakhehipi khādāpente, jīvantampi sūle uttāsente, asināpi sīsaṁ chin